        "content": "## 🤖 AI Extraction & Validation\nBoth pipelines converge here. GPT-4o-mini extracts vendor, amount, tax, currency, date, category, and description. A Set node then validates and normalises all fields — defaulting missing values, parsing numbers, and computing `totalWithTax`."
