        "height": 800,
        "content": "## 💰 High-Value Flag, Sheets & Airtable\nExpenses over 100 trigger a Slack alert to the finance channel for manual review. All expenses (high and low value) are appended to Google Sheets and logged to Airtable with `Status = Pending Review`. A 1s Wait prevents Notion rate limit errors."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
