      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "width": 532,
        "height": 332,
        "content": "## 🔑 Credentials Required\n- **Gmail OAuth2** — email trigger\n- **Telegram Bot API** — photo trigger + confirmation\n- **OpenAI API** — vision + text extraction\n- **Notion API** → `REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_NOTION_EXPENSES_DATABASE_ID`\n- **Google Sheets OAuth2** → `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID`\n- **Slack OAuth2** → `YOUR_SLACK_CHANNEL_ID`\n- **Airtable PAT** → base ID + table ID"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
